# Element subtype must be convertible to the declared subtype

Verifies a kilogram element cannot initialize an `int<mm>[]` array because no
conversion from kilogram to millimeter is registered.

>>> source
let sizes: int<mm>[] = [10mm, 5kg]

<<< stdout

<<< stderr
eck: conversion from `kilogram` to subtype `millimeter` is not defined at Span { start: 30, end: 33 }

<<< exit
1
